 "cues": [
  {
   "id": "1.town",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.4667,
   "text": "In this town, the fastest kid wins a trophy. And I was the slowest kid in town."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.witch",
   "start": 3.4667,
   "end": 6.0667,
   "text": "Then a witch gave me a pair of shoes. They had three buttons."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.buttons",
   "start": 6.0667,
   "end": 8.3,
   "text": "Light speed. Too fast. And just right."
  },
  {
   "id": "1.second",
   "start": 8.3,
   "end": 11.6333,
   "text": "I came second at the rivers. And the kid who came first was wearing the same shoes."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.turn",
   "start": 11.6333,
   "end": 14.2,
   "text": "He turned round. I was gone. He looked confused."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.tree",
   "start": 14.2,
   "end": 16.9,
   "text": "I was behind a tree. I could not believe it. The same shoes!"
  },
  {
   "id": "2.three",
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 20.1333,
   "text": "Then I heard three more runners come in. Third. Fourth. Fifth."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.baby",
   "start": 20.1333,
   "end": 22.4333,
   "text": "Fifth was the baby. The one who used to beat me."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.friends",
   "start": 22.4333,
   "end": 25.8667,
   "text": "Then two more came in. They were friends of first place. I looked at their feet."
  },
  {
   "id": "2.too",
   "start": 25.8667,
   "end": 27.3667,
   "text": "They were wearing those shoes too!"
  },
  {
   "id": "2.hide",
   "start": 27.3667,
   "end": 29.7667,
   "text": "I got back behind the tree. I did not peek anymore."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.idea",
   "start": 29.7667,
   "end": 30.9333,
   "text": "Then I had an idea."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.press",
   "start": 30.9333,
   "end": 32.8,
   "text": "I pressed the first button. Light speed."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.home",
   "start": 32.8,
   "end": 35.0,
   "text": "I ran from the rivers, all the way to my house."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.brush",
   "start": 35.0,
   "end": 37.4,
   "text": "I grabbed a paint brush. And I painted my shoes blue."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.why",
   "start": 37.4,
   "end": 39.6333,
   "text": "If they got found out, nobody would look at mine."
  },
  {
   "id": "3.back",
   "start": 39.6333,
   "end": 43.5333,
   "text": "Then I ran back, at the speed of light. And I pressed the third button again."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.hey",
   "start": 43.5333,
   "end": 45.9333,
   "text": "First place saw me. \"Hey. Where did you come from?\""
  },
  {
   "id": "4.froze",
   "start": 45.9333,
   "end": 48.0333,
   "text": "I froze. I did not expect a question."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.poop",
   "start": 48.0333,
   "end": 49.3333,
   "text": "\"I was pooping,\" I said."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.wow",
   "start": 49.3333,
   "end": 50.7667,
   "text": "Wow. What a great excuse."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.river",
   "start": 50.7667,
   "end": 52.7667,
   "text": "\"In the river?\" he said. I nodded."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.weird",
   "start": 52.7667,
   "end": 56.5333,
   "text": "He thought it was weird. But he was first place. He did not think about it much."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.blue",
   "start": 56.5333,
   "end": 59.4667,
   "text": "He looked at my shoes. Blue. Then he went back to his friends."
  },
  {
   "id": "4.sigh",
   "start": 59.4667,
   "end": 61.5,
   "text": "I sighed. He did not suspect a thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.later",
   "start": 61.5,
   "end": 64.0333,
   "text": "Ten minutes later, everybody was back. We lined up again."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.water",
   "start": 64.0333,
   "end": 65.7667,
   "text": "I drank a lot of water. I was ready."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.bend",
   "start": 65.7667,
   "end": 69.3,
   "text": "Then I saw first place and his friends bend down. They pressed something on their shoes."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.nervous",
   "start": 69.3,
   "end": 70.0333,
   "text": "I got nervous."
  },
  {
   "id": "5.go",
   "start": 70.0333,
   "end": 72.6667,
   "text": "Three. Two. One. Go!"
  },
  {
   "id": "5.ran",
   "start": 72.6667,
   "end": 75.0667,
   "text": "All of us ran! First place and his friends took the lead."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.forgot",
   "start": 75.0667,
   "end": 77.6,
   "text": "I had forgotten to change mine. They were still on the third button."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.notyet",
   "start": 77.6,
   "end": 80.4,
   "text": "I did not press it. Not yet. Those three might get caught."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.ninth",
   "start": 80.4,
   "end": 82.3333,
   "text": "So I blended in. I was ninth."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.desert",
   "start": 82.3333,
   "end": 84.2,
   "text": "Then we ran into the desert. It was hot."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.tired",
   "start": 84.2,
   "end": 87.4333,
   "text": "Everybody was exhausted. Me too. All the water I drank was gone."
  },
  {
   "id": "6.lead",
   "start": 87.4333,
   "end": 91.0667,
   "text": "Far in front, I could see the three of them. Still in the lead. But tired too."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.van",
   "start": 91.0667,
   "end": 94.3667,
   "text": "Then a van drove up next to us. \"You can get in, if you want to quit!\""
  },
  {
   "id": "7.angry",
   "start": 94.3667,
   "end": 97.4,
   "text": "That made me angry. All those years, I was the slowest one."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.no",
   "start": 97.4,
   "end": 98.5333,
   "text": "I was not getting in a van."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.press",
   "start": 98.5333,
   "end": 102.2333,
   "text": "So I bent down in the crowd, away from the cameras. And I pressed a button."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.jog",
   "start": 102.2333,
   "end": 106.4,
   "text": "I jogged. Too fast. I slowed down. Just right. A bit faster than before."
  },
  {
   "id": "7.run",
   "start": 106.4,
   "end": 108.6333,
   "text": "Then I ran. The van driver's mouth fell open."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.catch",
   "start": 108.6333,
   "end": 111.8,
   "text": "I was catching up. First place and his friends looked back. They were shocked."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.feet",
   "start": 111.8,
   "end": 115.0667,
   "text": "They looked at my feet. Blue shoes. His friends did not suspect a thing."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.maybe",
   "start": 115.0667,
   "end": 118.1,
   "text": "First place did. \"Maybe he painted them blue,\" he said."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.boom",
   "start": 118.1,
   "end": 121.2333,
   "text": "He got mad. He pressed his button. BOOM! He was gone."
  },
  {
   "id": "8.behind",
   "start": 121.2333,
   "end": 125.2333,
   "text": "His friends fell behind. I did not copy him. I stayed behind them, and I blended in."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.van",
   "start": 125.2333,
   "end": 128.3667,
   "text": "Then I saw the van again. The baby was inside it. He had quit!"
  },
  {
   "id": "9.ice",
   "start": 128.3667,
   "end": 130.3,
   "text": "But he had an ice cream. I was jealous."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.later",
   "start": 130.3,
   "end": 131.9,
   "text": "Seven minutes later, I was fourth."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.places",
   "start": 131.9,
   "end": 135.4333,
   "text": "His friends were second and third. And first place was still first place."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.drink",
   "start": 135.4333,
   "end": 137.5333,
   "text": "I was exhausted. I went to get a drink."
  },
  {
   "id": "9.walk",
   "start": 137.5333,
   "end": 140.8,
   "text": "And while I was drinking, first place walked up to me."
  },
  {
   "id": "10.sub",
   "start": 140.8,
   "end": 142.6667,
   "text": "Like and subscribe for part three."
  }
 ],
